WEBVTT

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.280
Wow! He's so cool!

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.290
It's a miracle we made it home alive.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:09.980
<i>Stop it...</i>

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.450
<i>Stop it, you idiot!</i>

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.340
<i>Akuruturuka...</i>

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.130
<i>Those granted the power of the masks.</i>

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.130
<i>Stop!</i>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.230
Haku?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.220
May we come in?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.270
Sure.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.360
U-Um...

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.400
You're still in bed?

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.910
It's sunset.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.280
It's my day off.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.910
Yeah, but...

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.570
There's a place we'd like you to go to with us.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.270
Please?

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:27.740
It's been a while since 
we've all gone out like this.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.060
Not since we first came to the capital.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.550
Back when Haku-san didn't work and just lazed about all day.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:39.360
Th-There was still a lot he 
didn't know back then.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.820
Right, Haku-sama?

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:45.760
Yeah! I couldn't believe 
he didn't know how to read.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.730
He was such a good-for-nothing back then.

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.750
That's the place.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.360
It's so cute.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.650
Yeah.

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:14.230
This would look perfect in your hair, Big Sister!

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:31.120
Catch you fancy?

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.020
Not really...

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.260
Listen, Haku...

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:42.260
You see, today, we wanted to...

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.080
What?

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.010
Nothing!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:49.430
Anyway, how about you wait for us in front of the store?

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.520
Hey, come on...

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.700
Sorry for the wait.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.230
You all done?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.040
Yeah, just one more thing.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.540
Here you go. It's from everyone.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.050
Open it later.

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:21.770
H-Haku-sama, y-you can't do it 
where{when? seems fine either way} other people are looking.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.850
What are you thinking?

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.780
Th-That's perverted!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.140
Yeah.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.810
Look at it later, when you're alone.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:32.470
Um, sure.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:46.070
Haku... A lot's happened, hasn't it?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.560
I was the first to find you...

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.090
Then we met all kinds of people.

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:04.500
Kuon...

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.220
What?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.600
In that war...

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.230
I couldn't do anything.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:14.480
Not a single thing.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.990
Hey! How dare you worry my sister like that!?

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.120
Nekone!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.010
And why do you look like

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.120
you're carrying the weight of the 
whole world on your shoulders?

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.620
Who do you think you are, anyway!?

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:39.630
Everyone's got their own problems to deal with, 
but they still have to do their best to survive!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.470
Snap out of it already!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.390
Haku!

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:49.890
Haku-sama!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.930
Haku-sama! Haku-sama!

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:58.650
Well, look at that.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.400
Kid sure looks like he's enjoying himself there.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.270
What is this?

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.700
Okay, let's get started!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.240
Yeah!

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.050
To Yamato's victory!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.300
It's on me tonight!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.870
Drink to your heart's content, everyone!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.690
Okay, cheers!

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:36.690
Cheers!

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:37.940
Cheers!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:45.200
We were just talking about having all 
the guys get together for a drink.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.700
No need to worry about the usual 
subtleties without the girls around.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.880
This isn't so bad every once in a while, is it?

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:55.760
I got us some good sake.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.090
Sometimes drinking makes you feel better.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.400
Haku-san!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.450
Finally joining in?

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.720
Master Haku!

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.250
How dearly I've missed you!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:26.120
Don't be so cold...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.330
Here, have some more.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.420
I simply yearn for love...

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:41.500
Oh? Now that I take a good look,
you're actually rather cute, Master Kiuru.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.260
H-Huh!?

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:43.750
H-Hang on...

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.260
Your skin is so luscious...

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.240
St-Stop it!

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:52.750
I have Nekone-san already...

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.890
That is no issue! No issue at all!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.780
I still require more love!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:15.430
You sure are a lively bunch.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.240
S-Stop that!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.770
So you're Yakutowaruto?

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.630
Wh-What do you think you're touching!?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.740
I hear you're good with a sword.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.730
Stop... Stop it!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.130
Hear you're not bad yourself, General{Gen?} Sakon.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.920
Stop it, please!

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:30.280
Well...

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:34.300
How 'bout a little match?

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.360
What, you're drunk already?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.570
What?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.940
Afraid of losing?

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:44.440
How are you gonna be a strong father like that?

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.470
So noisy...

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.190
You're drinking a lot.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.960
This is definitely quality sake.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.220
That's right.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.800
Hey, kiddo.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.350
Whole bunch of idiots, eh?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:24.770
You said it.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:28.610
But they're worried about you, 
even if it doesn't really show.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:40.500
Listen, why don't you just get it 
off your chest, whatever it is?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.710
Well, I won't force you.

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:47.270
I do understand how you feel.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:48.880
Do you really?

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:54.130
Do you really understand just how terrified I am now?

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:58.620
I do.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.060
Like hell you do!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.270
You're damn strong.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.920
You're a damned <i>veteran</i> when it comes to war.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.370
Haku...

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.650
I...

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:11.030
I...

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.780
couldn't protect a thing.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.270
Everyone's got to protect themselves.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.790
Everyone on the battlefield knows that.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:27.790
And I'm saying that I don't ever 
want to go back to that battlefield!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.100
That's not all.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.750
War changes everyone.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.550
They fight like it's the most 
normal thing in the world.

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.600
And I can't stop it...

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.900
I can't take that!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:47.680
I see.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:51.110
You prefer their usual selves, don't you?

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.230
Yeah, that's right.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.990
I'm happiest when I'm goofing 
around with them every day.

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:01.490
I felt like I'd finally found 
a place where I belonged.

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:05.620
But in that case, your only 
choice is to hang in there.

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.570
Even if you close your eyes and run away,

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.360
no matter where you go, nobody will be there.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:15.310
I've decided I'm going to protect 
the Emperor and the capital.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.170
Because they're the most 
important things to me.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.230
It's the same for you, right?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.260
I <i>know</i> that.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:25.540
You think I don't?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.100
It's just...

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.870
I'm afraid.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.690
M-Master Haku!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.480
I...

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.530
I was so terrified there without you!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:45.510
But I must work, or else I cannot pay off my family's debts.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.610
Haku-san...

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:50.860
You were <i>that</i> concerned about us?

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.420
I'm so happy!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.060
I'll...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.320
I'll do my best too, even if I'm scared!

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:57.100
You heard it.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:02.020
Doing your best for others 
is important, isn't it?

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.280
I'm able to fight because I have Shinonon.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.930
You guys...

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.690
Well, I'm invincible, so it's 
got nothing to do with me.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.940
What's so funny?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.930
Nekone?

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.070
You guys getting closer?

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:22.610
Shut up!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:23.700
You!

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:27.200
We're settling things right here and now!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.590
Do I look good?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:40.910
See?

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.390
Everyone's scared of war.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:46.090
That's why we drink.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:47.470
We party like fools.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:53.610
I believe in you, and so do they.

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:57.730
Don't you think you can have a little faith in them, too?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.740
Thanks, you guys.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:09.410
But I kind of feel like 
Ukon's trying to seduce me.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.260
That's disgusting.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.950
Having faith in your friends, huh?

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.330
Yeah.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.050
We're strong, you know.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:25.260
By the way...

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.320
If you're trying to make me feel better,

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.380
do a better job!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:33.960
I've been watching, and I think 
you guys just wanted to goof off.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:37.720
And it's weird how you wanted to have 
a party with just the guys all of a sudden!

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:38.780
You dummies!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:42.410
To make <i>you</i> feel better?

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:43.780
Was that really the point?

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.280
Who can say?

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.490
You think the whole world 
revolves around you, Master Haku.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.600
Damn you guys...

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.290
I really was worried about you, Haku-san.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:56.030
Probably.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.040
"Probably"?

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.830
Okay!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.260
Now that Haku's feeling better, 
let the drinking resume!

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.010
Yeah!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.050
All right, let's do it, Sacchan.

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:07.800
Right!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.190
You guys get ready, too!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:16.810
How is it, Nekone?

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.570
I can hear Haku-san, 
and he sounds like he's having fun.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.980
Thank goodness.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:24.940
It sounds like Haku's feeling better.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.750
Jeez, he's such a handful.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.830
There really is no better cure than some time with the other men.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:35.400
I guess I don't have a choice.
I'll lend him my brother for a little while.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:36.710
By the way,

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:42.210
we're going to leave these two clueless 
girls tied up a little while longer.

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.770
Got it.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.590
Leave it to us!

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:46.590
Um...

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:50.970
I think they've probably run out of food by now.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.100
Thanks, Rurutie.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.630
Haku, everyone?

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.480
I'm coming in!

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.490
Master Haku, your body is marvelous!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.290
You slackin' on me, kiddo!?

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.990
{I need to see you move it, like this!}{lit. "You have to move it so you're barely covering it, like this!"}{Hmm}You need longer swings! Riskier maneuvers!

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.260
I see... Like this?

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:18.940
Indeed. When it comes to the naked dance, lightning speed is of the essence.

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:20.380
Master the technique!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.770
I can see it! I can see it!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.580
You ain't coverin' up a thing!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.010
Kiuru-san.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.370
It's time for you to strip, too.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.770
I can't!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.270
Wha— Stop it, Ougi-san!

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:44.480
H-Haku-sama...

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:45.650
Everyone...

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:48.910
Is this a dream? A fantasy?

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:57.970
Well, lookie here.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:01.790
Guess the gents do the same things as us lasses.

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:06.420
N-No, Nekone-san!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.420
N-Nekone?

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:09.380
Your eyes are scaring me.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.740
Behold this gloriously toned specimen!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:16.430
There is nothing to be embarrassed about—

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:17.980
Disgusting.

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.370
Nekone-san!

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.740
Look at all the wormies{danglies}!

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.710
Shinonon, let's go somewhere else.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.450
Okay!

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:35.700
Kiuru's is the cutest!

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:40.820
Live strong, Kiuru.

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.370
Cheer up.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:43.710
I'm glad.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:47.130
Looks like you've really cheered up.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.010
Kuon...

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.880
Um, well...

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.510
I'm sorry.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.510
Nah, it's okay—

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.180
What's wrong, Kuon?

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:09.080
Haku... Haku, you dummy!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.460
Ow...

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:26.770
Ow, ow, ow...

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.930
The handwriting's too good.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:59.030
It says they're worried about you.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.800
It's like a love letter.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.180
You shouldn't read over people's shoulders.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:06.840
Sorry.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:10.440
I didn't think Nekone would 
send you one too, though.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.960
Maybe I'll show it to Kiuru later.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.330
Give the guy a break.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:36.480
I'm grateful to them.

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.290
Yeah.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:47.000
Can you really keep from changing, though?

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.630
You mean the power of the masks?

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:56.130
It may be more powerful 
than most can handle.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.240
But it's a sign of the Emperor's trust in me.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:02.810
I believe in him.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:08.310
War won't vanish from this world anytime soon.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:11.190
But someday...

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:17.220
Well, there are some things in this world 
that no amount of worrying will change.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.620
And when that happens, 
you do what we did today.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.410
Drink and laugh it off.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.580
That's certainly like you.

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:28.030
I used to fret over things, too.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:33.210
But at some point,
 I just stopped thinking about it.

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.850
Good, bad, all of that included.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.160
I've become a pretty awful grown-up.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.740
Yeah.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:56.490
But I still don't like war...
